<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Voice: warm, calm and plain. Sentence case. At most one emoji, at the end.
    Terms (use exactly these):
      Bumblebee / Bumblebees  a friend who looks after your garden (code calls them "approvers")
      garden                  your limits together
      limit                   time allowed for one app, per day and/or week
      resting                 an app whose time is up for now
      extra time              what you ask a Bumblebee for
      say yes / not today     a Bumblebee's answers
      emergency unlock        lifting limits without a Bumblebee
    The backend's functions/src/copy.ts uses the same terms for notifications.
-->
